{"version":1,"content":"<p>周柏豪《The Blooming Chapter 綻放之章》粉絲見面演唱會廣州站，日前於廣州體育館順利舉行，2晚演出盛况空前，座無虛席。</p><p>隨廣州站落幕，官方亦帶來好消息，即將於11月7日舉行的澳門生日限定場，門票一開售秒殺售罄，主辦隨即買下旺角彌敦道billboard，為柏豪送上最佳生日禮物。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:01:37.781513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.548371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:18.660517+00:00","content_hash":"96582af30def12f75460d798703dd9e9c3d5c32328fc009c5ae6662fe1ba0ada","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}